-- Khanh Binh, Phu Huu; 2026 FPT admissions secondary school directory.
-- The original historical lists were excluded after checking multiple 2026 mergers:
-- old campuses may be separate branches, NOT independently operating schools.
-- Migration never deletes/updates old data, does not assert verified GPS,
-- and must only be applied after CI and review of the current production schema.
-- Sources, old district and map search links are preserved for repeatable audit.
